---
import '../styles/features.css';
import { MORE, NEXT } from '../lib/feature-cards.mjs';
// Homepage "收工之後": each feature as a small working piece of the real UI.
// Thumbnails, file names and scene lines are cut from the real screenshot
// (docs/img/arkiv-ui.webp); transcript lines and timecodes are illustrative.
// Motion only runs while a stage is on screen (.on), and not at all under
// prefers-reduced-motion, where every stage shows its finished state.
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const img = (n: string) => `${base}/img/feat/${n}.webp`;
// Real peaks of A7520260820_9908.MP4 from /api/media/85/waveform (2026-10-05).
const peaks = [0.42,0.48,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.01,0.02,0.01,0.01,0.54,0.75,0.35,0.36,0.02,0.37,0.59,0.02,0.41,0.35,0.01,0.72,0.42,0.02,0.58,0.24,0.55,0.68,0.02,0.02,0.76,0.09,0.05,0.67,0.41,0.39,0.75,0.04,0.6,0.75,0.75,0.57,0.04,0.01,0.02,0.09,0.06,0.4,0.12,0.01,0.02,0.7];
---
<section class="feat-sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>收工之後</h2>
    <p class="feat-lede">過片、挑毛片、分類場景、轉字幕。下面每一格都是 arkiv 介面裡實際有的東西。</p>
    <div class="feat-grid">

      <article class="feat feat-wide">
        <div class="stage st-dit" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="dt-src"><span class="dt-label">CARD · A001</span><span class="dt-keep">來源卡不刪除</span></div>
          <div class="dt-dsts">
            {['BACKUP_1', 'BACKUP_2'].map((d, di) => (
              <div class="dt-dst">
                <span class="dt-label">{d}</span>
                {['9896', '9895', '9894'].map((n, i) => (
                  <div class="dt-row" style={`--d:${(di * 0.25 + i * 0.55).toFixed(2)}s`}>
                    <span class="dt-name">A7520260818_{n}.MP4</span>
                    <span class="dt-bar"><i></i></span>
                    <span class="dt-ok">xxh3 OK</span>
                  </div>
                ))}
                <span class="dt-mhl" style={`--d:${(di * 0.25 + 2.1).toFixed(2)}s`}>ascmhl OK</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>收工先轉存：一張卡，同時拷到兩顆碟</h3>
        <p>每個檔都做 hash 比對，拷到一半中斷可以接著跑，結束時每顆碟各留一份 ASC MHL 校驗清單。<b>它從不刪除來源卡。</b>介面上按「DIT」就能開始，逐檔看得到進度。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feat">
        <div class="stage st-scene" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="sn-row"><span class="sn-tc">00:00</span><span class="sn-tag">A-Roll</span><span class="sn-txt">一個人在工作桌前使用筆記本電腦編輯照片。</span></div>
          <div class="sn-row"><span class="sn-tc">00:06</span><span class="sn-tag">A-Roll</span><span class="sn-txt">一個人在電腦前編輯照片。</span></div>
          <div class="sn-row"><span class="sn-tc">00:12</span><span class="sn-tag">B-Roll</span><span class="sn-txt">一名男子在工作桌前使用電腦和筆記本。</span></div>
        </div>
        <h3>場景時間軸</h3>
        <p>視覺模型逐場景寫描述與標籤，沒有對白的空景也搜得到。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feat">
        <div class="stage st-search" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="se-box"><span class="se-ico"></span><span class="se-q">手寫特寫</span><i class="se-caret"></i></div>
          <div class="se-res">
            {['9887', '9885', '9891', '9889'].map((n) => <img src={img(n)} alt="" width="160" height="91" loading="lazy" decoding="async">)}
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>用口語搜尋</h3>
        <p>比對的是畫面內容和逐字稿的意思，不是檔名。中文、日文、英文都可以。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feat">
        <div class="stage st-rate" aria-hidden="true">
          {[['9896', 'GOOD', 'good'], ['9895', 'REV', 'rev'], ['9894', 'N·G', 'ng']].map(([n, label, k]) => (
            <figure class={`rt rt-${k}`}>
              <img src={img(n)} alt="" width="160" height="91" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              <figcaption><span class="rt-name">A7520260818_{n}.MP4</span><b class="rt-stamp">{label}</b></figcaption>
            </figure>
          ))}
        </div>
        <h3>評等掛在素材上</h3>
        <p>GOOD、REV、N·G 直接標在素材上，Smart Pool 自動分成待審、可用、不用。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feat">
        <div class="stage st-script" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="sc-bar"><i class="sc-head"></i></div>
          <ol class="sc-lines">
            <li><span>00:02</span>今天先從桌面開始拍</li>
            <li class="sc-hit"><span>00:11</span>這一段我們再試一次</li>
            <li><span>00:19</span>好，換手部特寫</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <h3>點逐字稿，跳到那一句</h3>
        <p>點一句就跳到那一句真正的位置。可匯出 SRT、VTT 或純文字。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feat feat-wide">
        <div class="stage st-inout" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="io-head"><span class="io-eyebrow">WAVEFORM</span><span class="io-read">IN <b class="io-v io-in">00:00:04:17</b> · OUT <b class="io-v io-out">00:00:09:02</b></span></div>
          <div class="io-wf">
            <div class="io-sel"></div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 60 56" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="io-svg">
              {peaks.map((v, i) => <rect x={i + 0.15} y={(56 - Math.max(2, v * 50)) / 2} width="0.7" height={Math.max(2, v * 50)} />)}
            </svg>
            <div class="io-mk io-mk-in"></div>
            <div class="io-mk io-mk-out"></div>
            <div class="io-ph"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="io-tools">
            <span class="io-btn">◂ 格</span><span class="io-btn">格 ▸</span><span class="io-frame">f395 · 00:00:06:35 · 59.940fps</span>
          </div>
          <div class="io-tools">
            <span class="io-btn io-press-in">設 IN</span><span class="io-btn io-press-out">設 OUT</span><span class="io-btn io-dim">清除</span><span class="io-count">285 格</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>波形與逐格 IN／OUT</h3>
        <p>有聲音的素材直接看波形。按 <span class="mono">i</span>、<span class="mono">o</span> 或直接拖曳標記；可以一格一格移動，標點貼齊真正的格邊界，59.94p 也對得準。匯出 EDL、SRT 時套用這個區間。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feat feat-wide">
        <div class="stage st-resolve" aria-hidden="true">
          <ul class="rv-src">
            <li class="g">A7520260818_9896.MP4</li>
            <li class="y">A7520260818_9895.MP4</li>
            <li class="o">A7520260818_9894.MP4</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="rv-pool"><span class="rv-label">Media Pool</span>
            <i class="rv-clip g"></i><i class="rv-clip y"></i><i class="rv-clip o"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>一鍵進 Resolve，時間碼對得上</h3>
        <p>搜尋結果帶著 clip color 匯入 Media Pool（GOOD 綠、REV 黃、N·G 橘），依攝影機自動分 bin。匯出 EDL、FCPXML 時用攝影機本身的時間碼加上你標的 IN 點，relink 回原始檔落在同一格。</p>
      </article>

    </div>

    <h3 class="feat-tier">還有這些</h3>
    {MORE.map((g) => (
      <div class="card-group">
        <h4 class="card-group-h">{g.group}</h4>
        <div class="card-row">
          {g.items.map((it) => (
            <article class="mini">
              <svg class="mini-art" viewBox="0 0 160 90" aria-hidden="true" set:html={it.art} />
              <h5>{it.t}</h5>
              <p>{it.d}</p>
              <span class={`more-where${it.tag ? ` tag-${it.tag}` : ''}`}>{it.w}</span>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}

    <h3 class="feat-tier">接下來</h3>
    <p class="next-note">規劃中，還沒做好，也沒有承諾時程。</p>
    <div class="card-row next">
      {NEXT.map((it) => (
        <article class="mini mini-next">
          <svg class="mini-art" viewBox="0 0 160 90" aria-hidden="true" set:html={it.art} />
          <h5>{it.t}</h5>
          <p>{it.d}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="feat-note">上方動畫是介面示意；縮圖、檔名與場景描述取自實際畫面，逐字稿、時間碼與轉存進度為示範。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  // Run each stage only while it is on screen.
  (function () {
    var stages = document.querySelectorAll('.feat .stage');
    if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { stages.forEach(function (s) { s.classList.add('on'); }); return; }
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (es) {
      es.forEach(function (e) { e.target.classList.toggle('on', e.isIntersecting); });
    }, { threshold: 0.35 });
    stages.forEach(function (s) { io.observe(s); });
  })();
</script>
